{"name": "Lost and Found Co.", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras_big/d468b1fc970807561501a51c438f4875.webp?t=1787801815\" height=\"307\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/d468b1fc970807561501a51c438f4875.avif?t=1787801815\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/8955ead2df1d3594ac1d5c3ed6d486dc.poster.avif?t=1787801815\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/8955ead2df1d3594ac1d5c3ed6d486dc.webm?t=1787801815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/8955ead2df1d3594ac1d5c3ed6d486dc.mp4?t=1787801815\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lost and Found Co.</strong> is a whimsical hidden object game where you help Ducky, a duck-turned-human intern, at Goddess Mei\u2019s company - a magical startup dedicated to finding lost items for its quirky townspeople.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras_big/b7d9e88de467c1b48bb4f969d14aa188.webp?t=1787801815\" height=\"328\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/b7d9e88de467c1b48bb4f969d14aa188.avif?t=1787801815\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2728 Hunt for well-hidden items in engaging  levels!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your object-hunting skills to the test on these fun, challenging levels, delivering pure hidden-object gameplay goodness. Endless fun awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/8b0b71a372e28b44c984bbad7a86728b.poster.avif?t=1787801815\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/8b0b71a372e28b44c984bbad7a86728b.webm?t=1787801815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/8b0b71a372e28b44c984bbad7a86728b.mp4?t=1787801815\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf3f Experience the breathtaking locales!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through charming locales that bring your childhood puzzle books to life in a heartwarming and whimsical world filled with a bunch of items to discover, offering a joyful escape for players of all ages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/b438276d901558047b05d5bd7b2e1609.poster.avif?t=1787801815\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/b438276d901558047b05d5bd7b2e1609.webm?t=1787801815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/b438276d901558047b05d5bd7b2e1609.mp4?t=1787801815\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udcad Find out the goings-on in this wholesome place!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Return lost items to their rightful owners in this adorable world, filled with thousands of interactive objects and characters, all with their own intriguing stories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/8691d02a1b917d91f22412337b41cdaa.poster.avif?t=1787801815\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/8691d02a1b917d91f22412337b41cdaa.webm?t=1787801815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/8691d02a1b917d91f22412337b41cdaa.mp4?t=1787801815\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udce6 Decorate Ducky\u2019s Room!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate Ducky\u2019s bedroom using tons of cute assets available in a robust and easy-to-use room editor. Cute? Gothic? Goofy? Express your creativity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/f40a7931d8f8b0bfad967a389113a75d.poster.avif?t=1787801815\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/f40a7931d8f8b0bfad967a389113a75d.webm?t=1787801815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/f40a7931d8f8b0bfad967a389113a75d.mp4?t=1787801815\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras_big/88e772aa447a18d23dc102769ffdbb2f.webp?t=1787801815\" height=\"331\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/88e772aa447a18d23dc102769ffdbb2f.avif?t=1787801815\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single-player hidden object story campaign \ud83d\udd0e</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bonus challenge levels testing your keen eyes \ud83d\udc40</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Highly interactive levels where you can click on anything! \ud83d\udc46</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Renovate your office and customize Ducky\u2019s Room \ud83d\udce6</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Uncover easter eggs and surprises hidden in this magical world!!! \ud83c\udf08</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/c3872725c6fa9c0960a8c91271aacc40.poster.avif?t=1787801815\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/c3872725c6fa9c0960a8c91271aacc40.webm?t=1787801815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/c3872725c6fa9c0960a8c91271aacc40.mp4?t=1787801815\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Lost and Found Co. is a hidden object adventure in a cozy and immersive world. Join a cast of lively characters on their epic journey across countless magical locations. Find lost items, solve puzzles, and help a tiny dragon regain her power!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/823b2eb9c211975e24e24dd0d5f1720d5669d10e/header.jpg?t=1787801815", "s